id: massive-tornado
name: Massive Tornado
advancement: true
prerequisite: Insight Score of 6+
tpCost: 4
massiveTornado: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Spinning: Melee Range 2 more, the Sweeping Profile's AoE a Magnitude larger.
text: >
  Massive Tornado: The cyclone surrounding you extends out beyond your physical reach, striking enemies with the force of the wind alone.
  –Prerequisites: Insight Score of 6+
  –TP Cost: 4
  –Effect: While you are Spinning, increase your Melee Range by 2 and the AoE of the Sweeping Profile by 1 Magnitude.
